  m_text: "Christchurch Cathedral Choir is New Zealand\u2019s only professional choir
    for trebles and adults, and one of two in the southern hemisphere with its own
    choir school. Though the quake silenced the old building, this tradition lives
    on through its junior choristers at the Transitional Cathedral.\n\n_________________________________________\n\nKnow
    more\n"
